{"seq":3,"slug":"treatment-vendor-qualification-evidence","title":"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/treatment-vendor-qualification-evidence","wordCount":3197,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操\">处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操</h1><p>卖家在 ERP 里勾选「已交有资质处置商」只需一次点击，但这条勾选背后是一整套可被监管、平台与审计追问的<strong>证据链</strong>：对方是否持有该法域承认的处理资质、资质此刻是否在有效期内、交出的重量与拿回的凭证能否对上、跨境那一程是否有事先知情同意。任何一环断了，卖家承担的后果不是「服务商不专业」，而是<strong>自己被认定为非法转移或申报不实</strong>——在欧盟委员会 2024/1157 号条例把出口审查收紧之后，这个风险已经从前置审批延伸到事后审计。</p>\n<p>本文处理的是<strong>执行面</strong>：如何核验一个处置商、如何读懂它给的凭证、如何把这些核验沉淀成可复查的台账。工艺原理见 <a href=\"dismantling-recycling-process\">拆解处置与资源化工艺模型</a>，回收率数字口径见 <a href=\"recycling-rate-data-accounting\">回收率与处置数据核算方法</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-资质核验的三个层次\">核心概念：资质核验的三个层次</h2><p>把「处置商有没有资质」当一个问题问，几乎一定会得到一个含糊的回答。合规上它必须拆成三层，因为每一层的颁发机构、失效条件和举证方式都不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>证明什么</th>\n<th>典型凭证</th>\n<th>颁发/登记方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>许可层</strong>（许可/备案）</td>\n<td>法律允许其接收并处理该类废物</td>\n<td>环境许可、危废经营许可证、处理企业名录在册</td>\n<td>主管部门（英国环境署、德国 stiftung ear、中国生态环境部等）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>能力层</strong>（管理体系认证）</td>\n<td>其工艺达到公认技术标准</td>\n<td>EN 50625 / WEEELABEX、R2v3、e-Stewards、EfbV</td>\n<td>认可认证机构（accredited certification body）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>账户层</strong>（申报账户）</td>\n<td>其能把处理量接入法定申报系统</td>\n<td>处理设施账户、证据票（evidence note）、电子转移联单账户</td>\n<td>主管部门/清算机构</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层缺一不可且<strong>不可互相替代</strong>：一家持有 R2v3 认证的企业，如果没有该国的处理许可，仍然不能合法接收；反之有许可却无能力认证，则其交出的回收率极可能不被 PRO 采信。跨境卖家常犯的错误是只看了第二层的证书扫描件，就跳过了第一层的登记状态与第三层的申报账户。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选处置商] --&gt; B{许可层核验&lt;br/&gt;官方登记状态查询}&#10;  B --&gt;|不通过| X[淘汰]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| C{能力层核验&lt;br/&gt;认证证书 + 认可范围}&#10;  C --&gt;|不通过| X&#10;  C --&gt;|通过| D{账户层核验&lt;br/&gt;申报账户/联单账户已验证}&#10;  D --&gt;|不通过| X&#10;  D --&gt;|通过| E[准入]&#10;  E --&gt; F[合同绑定凭证交付义务]&#10;  F --&gt; G[每批次核对&lt;br/&gt;重量/凭证/台账三单一致]&#10;  G --&gt; H{年度复审&lt;br/&gt;资质有效期 + 抽查}&#10;  H --&gt;|失效/降级| I[暂停投料&lt;br/&gt;转入备选商]&#10;  H --&gt;|通过| G\">graph TD\n  A[候选处置商] --&gt; B{许可层核验&lt;br/&gt;官方登记状态查询}\n  B --&gt;|不通过| X[淘汰]\n  B --&gt;|通过| C{能力层核验&lt;br/&gt;认证证书 + 认可范围}\n  C --&gt;|不通过| X\n  C --&gt;|通过| D{账户层核验&lt;br/&gt;申报账户/联单账户已验证}\n  D --&gt;|不通过| X\n  D --&gt;|通过| E[准入]\n  E --&gt; F[合同绑定凭证交付义务]\n  F --&gt; G[每批次核对&lt;br/&gt;重量/凭证/台账三单一致]\n  G --&gt; H{年度复审&lt;br/&gt;资质有效期 + 抽查}\n  H --&gt;|失效/降级| I[暂停投料&lt;br/&gt;转入备选商]\n  H --&gt;|通过| G</pre><p>关键设计原则：<strong>核验不是一次性事件，而是一个带复审回路的循环</strong>。证书会过期、登记会被暂停、认证机构会因不符合项撤销资格，任何静态的「已准入」标记都会随时间腐化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"各法域的官方核验入口\">各法域的官方核验入口</h2><p>许可层最可靠的核验方式是<strong>在主管部门的公开登记系统里查到该设施</strong>，而不是接受对方发来的 PDF 许可证。理由很直接：许可证复印件无法反映当前的暂停、整改或吊销状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>主要资质形态</th>\n<th>官方核验途径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td>AATF（批准的授权处理设施）；产出 WEEE 证据票</td>\n<td>环境署（Environment Agency）公开环境信息登记册，可查许可状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>德国</td>\n<td>Erstbehandlungsanlage（初次处理设施）；处置企业 EfbV 认证</td>\n<td>stiftung ear 负责 ElektroG 实施与登记，并提供公开名录与 ear-Portal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>废弃电器电子产品处理企业名录（在册方可获基金支持）；危废经营许可证</td>\n<td>生态环境部/财政部联合公告的名录，危废许可由省级生态环境部门核发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟通用</td>\n<td>EN 50625 系列符合性；跨境转移须经 PIC</td>\n<td>WEEELABEX 认证登记（该体系覆盖 21 国、约 443 家认证运营商，见 <a href=\"https://www.weee-forum.org/standards/\">WEEELABEX</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>美国/国际</td>\n<td>R2v3（SERI 管理）、e-Stewards（Basel Action Network 发起，标准 v4.1 于 2022-02-22 发布）</td>\n<td>SERI 认证设施目录、e-Stewards 许可企业查询</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>e-Stewards 的认证结构值得作为「能力层」的样本理解：它以 ISO 14001 或 RIOS 环境管理体系为底座，叠加 NAID AAA / i-Sigma 数据销毁认证、巴塞尔公约合规与<strong>下游全链条到最终处置的可问责性</strong>（downstream accountability）。认证由独立认可机构执行，首次认证进入三年合同期——第二、三年为监督审核（surveillance audit），第三年做全量再认证，另设不预先通知的飞行检查与 GPS 追踪。这意味着<strong>一张证书必须是「当前有效」的，且要能指出它处于三年周期的哪一年</strong>：处于第二年监督审核未通过状态的证书，与已失效的证书风险等级相同。</p>\n<p>对跨境卖家而言，一个务实的核验清单是：许可证号 + 登记状态截图 + 认证证书号 + 认证机构名称 + 证书有效期 + 下游去向声明。任何一项缺失，就把它降级为「待补证」，不要因为商务压力先放行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据凭证-三单一致是唯一的硬标准\">数据凭证：三单一致是唯一的硬标准</h2><p>资质只解决「谁可以处理」，数据凭证解决「是否真的处理了、处理了多少」。后者的判据是<strong>三单一致</strong>：卖家发出的重量、处置商收讫并登记的重量、以及最终进入申报系统的重量，必须能相互印证。</p>\n<p>凭证的主要形态有三类：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>质量平衡表 / 处理证明</strong>：记录入厂重量、去污染移除的危险组件、各产出流的重量与去向（再循环、能量回收、焚烧、填埋）。这是回收率核算的原始输入，其口径见 <a href=\"recycling-rate-data-accounting\">回收率与处置数据核算方法</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>证据票 / 回收声明</strong>（英国 evidence note、部分法域的 Verwertungsnachweis）：由处理设施或其所属清算体系签发，用于向监管或 PRO 证明「该批 WEEE 已妥善处理」，是生产者履行义务的直接凭据。</li>\n<li><strong>危废转移联单 / 电子清单</strong>：针对去污染环节产生的危险组件（电池、汞灯、含 PCB 电容等），随运输流转的单据。美国环保署的 e-Manifest 通过 RCRAInfo 系统实现统一转移清单的电子传递与更正，并已就 <strong>FY2026–2027（2025-10-01 至 2027-09-30）</strong> 发布用户费；EPA 于 <strong>2026-03-05</strong> 进一步提议逐步取纸质清单、转向全电子系统（<a href=\"https://www.epa.gov/e-manifest\">EPA e-Manifest</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>凭证核验的核心是<strong>重量守恒</strong>。设某批次申报的发出重量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，处置商登记的收讫重量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>recv</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{recv}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，法定允许的计量与含水率偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，则核验通过条件为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>recv</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>ship</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left| M_{\\text{ship}} - M_{\\text{recv}} \\right| \\le \\delta \\cdot M_{\\text{ship}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">ship</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若该批次还拆分为更细的处理量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>treat</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{treat}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与危废移除量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>haz</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{haz}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">haz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则处理商报告须满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>recv</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>treat</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>haz</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{recv}} \\approx M_{\\text{treat}} + M_{\\text{haz}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">recv</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treat</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">haz</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的量级一致。<strong>三单出现持续单向偏差时，往往不是计量误差，而是整批货物被转卖给了未登记的下游</strong>——这是监管稽查最先看的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境那一程-pic-通知与电子化\">跨境那一程：PIC 通知与电子化</h2><p>只要报废品跨越国境，凭证就从「处理证明」升级为「转移合法性证明」，管辖规则是《巴塞尔公约》与欧盟的废物运输条例。2024 年 5 月 20 日生效的欧盟条例 <strong>(EU) 2024/1157</strong> 取代了原 1013/2006 号条例并分阶段适用：<strong>大部分条款自 2026-05-21 起适用，多数出口规则自 2027-05-21 起适用</strong>；在适用日之前仍按 2006 年条例执行（<a href=\"https://environment.ec.europa.eu/topics/waste-and-recycling/waste-shipments_en\">欧盟委员会废物运输专题</a>）。</p>\n<p>对证据链影响最大的三条变化是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>电子化</strong>：自 2026 年 5 月起，运输程序通过欧盟中央系统（DIWASS）电子处理，委员会实施条例 (EU) 2025/1290 规定了中央系统与各国系统间的互操作要求。纸面通知与书面同意正在被系统内的状态记录取代。</li>\n<li><strong>出口目的地收窄</strong>：向非 OECD 国家的处置类废物与危险废物回收出口维持禁令；自 2027-05-21 起，非危险的「绿色清单」废物对非 OECD 国家的出口也将普遍禁止，仅保留提出接收请求并证明具备无害环境处理能力的国家。塑料废物另自 2026-11-21 起适用独立禁令。</li>\n<li><strong>出口方审计义务</strong>：出口者须通过<strong>独立设施审计</strong>核实境外设施的无害环境管理，审计不通过即须停止向该设施发货。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>同时，电子废弃物的巴塞尔条目已更新：危险电子废弃物由新的 <strong>A1181</strong> 取代原 A1180，非危险电子废弃物列入附件 II 的 <strong>Y49</strong>（欧盟通过授权条例 (EU) 2024/3229 与 2024/3230 落地，电子废弃物规则自 2025-01-01 起适用）。实务后果是：<strong>从欧盟出口电子废弃物到非 OECD 国家一律禁止；出口至 OECD 国家及进口入欧盟均适用事先知情同意（PIC）程序</strong>；欧盟内部转移原则上也需 PIC，仅非危险的 GC010/GC020 条目在 2026 年底前仍走一般信息程序。</p>\n<p>因此，核验跨境处置商的凭证时，要看的不只是「有没有 PIC」，而是<strong>PIC 是否覆盖了本批次、进口国与过境国是否都已书面同意、以及通知编号能否在系统中查到</strong>。任一环节缺失，运输即构成非法——而承担该责任的是出口方，也就是卖家自己。危险废物的<strong>鉴别标准同样不统一</strong>：中国的《国家危险废物名录》以 HW 编码分类（拆解相关多归 HW49），与欧盟按危险特性判定的路径不同，同一批物料可能在中欧两地得出不同的危废判定，进而影响可转移性与成本。发货前必须先明确适用哪一法域的鉴别规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把核验沉淀为持续台账\">把核验沉淀为持续台账</h2><p>一次性核验最大的问题是它不进系统。一个可运营的做法是给每个处置商建立<strong>资质台账</strong>，字段至少包括：许可编号与登记状态、认证种类与证书号、认证机构、颁发日与到期日、适用的废物类别与工艺范围、每次复审日期、以及受托的申报账户信息。</p>\n<p>台账的关键设计是<strong>有效性与权重的联合判定</strong>。设一个处置商 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 在时点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的资质有效标志为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>valid</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{valid}_j(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，其承接的处置量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则组合层面的<strong>有效资质覆盖率</strong>为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mtext>valid</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(t) = \\frac{\\sum_j w_j \\cdot \\text{valid}_j(t)}{\\sum_j w_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6976em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">valid</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 低于阈值时应触发告警，而不是等到下一轮年度评审——因为它下降的唯一原因是某家供应商的资质在某个批次投料期间已经失效。这个指标把「资质到期」从一个纸面日期，变成了一个<strong>按处置量加权的实时风险敞口</strong>。</p>\n<p>台账还要绑定<strong>凭证交付义务</strong>：在合同里写明每批次应交付的凭证种类（处理证明、证据票、危废单据）、交付时限与不符时的补救路径。这正是 EPR 体系下最常见的断点——卖家完成了交投，却没有把凭证收回，于是当平台或监管要求举证时，手上有付款记录却没有处理证明。凭证缺失的处理量在申报中通常只能按最不利口径处理。</p>\n<p>最后是留存与审计。凭证的保存期应覆盖该法域的法定保存年限与该批产品投放市场的申报周期（EPR 申报通常按年回溯），且需能按批次、按品类、按处置商三个维度检索。审计时的标准追问是：「请出示编号 X 的批次从出厂到最终处置的全部单据」——能在一个界面上回答这个问题，才算把资质核验真正做成了可复查的流程，而不是一份躺在共享盘里的 PDF 合集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处置商资质核验不是一次性文件审查，而是「资质有效—处理范围匹配—批次凭证回收」三层同时成立的持续校验，缺任一层都无法支撑 EPR 申报。</li>\n<li>三单一致（交投、过磅/计量、最终处理凭证）按批次闭环，是把「已付费处理」升级为「可举证处理」的唯一硬标准；PIC 通知与电子联单则是跨境危废转移的额外合法要件。</li>\n<li>凭证须合同化约定交付种类与时限，并按批次、品类、处置商三维留存，覆盖法定保存年限与申报回溯周期，才能在审计中还原从出厂到最终处置的完整链路。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操","id":"处置商资质核验与数据凭证实操"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：资质核验的三个层次","id":"核心概念-资质核验的三个层次"},{"level":2,"text":"各法域的官方核验入口","id":"各法域的官方核验入口"},{"level":2,"text":"数据凭证：三单一致是唯一的硬标准","id":"数据凭证-三单一致是唯一的硬标准"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境那一程：PIC 通知与电子化","id":"跨境那一程-pic-通知与电子化"},{"level":2,"text":"把核验沉淀为持续台账","id":"把核验沉淀为持续台账"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"回收率与处置数据核算方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/treatment-recycling-data/recycling-rate-data-accounting"},"next":{"title":"WEEE/EPR 合规成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-endoflife-waste-weee-compliance/waste-compliance-cost/compliance-cost-model"}}